🚀 MLOps Preparation Guide

1. Core Foundations You Must Master

Programming & Environment
- Python (non-negotiable): Scripting, data structures, error handling, building CLI tools
- Bash & Linux: Navigating directories, managing files, reading logs, writing shell scripts
- Git & Version Control: Branching, commits, PRs — GitOps is becoming the standard for deployment automation
- SQL: Joins, filters, aggregations for extracting datasets and validating data quality

ML Fundamentals
You don't need deep math, but you must understand:
- Train/test/validation splits, overfitting/underfitting
- Hyperparameters, evaluation metrics (accuracy, precision, recall, F1, AUC-ROC)
- Core libraries: Scikit-learn, TensorFlow/PyTorch, XGBoost/LightGBM

