7. Key Best Practices to Memorize

1. Version Everything: Code (Git), data (DVC), models (MLflow), features (Feature Store)
2. Make Every Experiment Reproducible: Log code commit, data version, hyperparameters, environment info
3. Infrastructure as Code: Use Terraform/CloudFormation — rebuild your ML stack in minutes
4. Plan for Retraining: Define time-based (weekly/monthly) or event-based (drift detection) triggers
5. Build Evaluation Gates: Every pipeline stage needs go/no-go decisions
6. Cost Optimization: Use spot/preemptible instances for training (3-5x cheaper), right-size GPU instances for serving

